  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainability Summit - Colombia 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="3" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1000

The summit is aimed at summoning key stakeholders in Colombia and Latin America interested in positioning wider conversations around sustainability</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Facilitate an open and wide dialogue between multiple actors around challenges and opportunities in Colombia towards a greener development.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Sustainability Summit 2024 serves as a large conversation and ideas exchange platform in Colombia to converse around the main challenges and opportunities that the country and the region face towards a world where climate action is needed.</narrative>
